// 2026-11-16 (landing 177d2b8, row 1: DEF-674's rest, P2). THE ROW'S PRICES FROM tests/backend/programs/store_path_cast_written_ok.npk, moved here by
// DEF-584's precedent (rulings l.1995, l.11093 item 5, l.13126): the 24 cells that stood there, each its face's text in store_path_cast_written.npk with the
// growth (`discard(raw growh(hq));`) dropped, are right programs main runs to 67. The row refuses each at the function value's cast store (BORROW-015, one
// site): a result that doesn't fit its argument is read as a retype of it, the reading main gives the named call. Each is marked PRICE and followed by its
// TWIN, the same cell with the call made to the named callee (management's `spcw_ok_nm` spelling), which main refuses at the same site: at parity. `x_gen_nm`
// is the by-name twin of the face `x_gen`, whose cast store the row refuses in store_path_cast_written.npk. `u_ffld_ok`, `u_ffldc_ok` and `c_held_ok` name
// their function-typed field `fx`, apart from the cell's own `func:f`, which takes the suffix.
// THE PRICES: `r_fv1_ok`, `r_fv2_ok`, `r_fvg_ok`, `u_ffld_ok`, `u_ffldc_ok`, `u_fparam_ok`, `u_fpick_ok`, `u_fter_ok`, `w_idx_ok`, `w_nest_ok`, `c_nmx_ok`,
// `c_sl_ok`, `c_two_ok`, `c_twoc_ok`, `x_gen_ok`, `c_held_ok`, `c_recv_ok`, `c_fvfv_ok`, `k_fva_ok`, `k_fvm_ok`, `k_arrn_ok`, `k_arrs_ok`, `r_fvl_ok`,
// `c_ptl_ok`.
